versus B4 0.82256. Rejected.\n- U2 independent token-resolved mask-language screen: repeat mismatch 0; oracle higher 179/388 versus shifted-language 182/388; standalone 0.00814 versus B4 0.82256. Rejected.\n- Archived source probes, paired raw JSON, diagnosis/review/design and hashes. No backward, training-resource gate, model/config package, admission receipt, training sync, dispatch or queue mutation. Inference peaks 3.60/3.56 GiB are not training peaks.\n- No pending questions in snapshot. Bounded distinct routes exhausted this cycle, not global hypothesis exhaustion.\n\n## 5. Decisions Made\n- 2026-09-27 01:00 `route_change`: reject U1/U2; leave both server-2 slots unqueued. See `pipeline/decisions/20260927-010053_route_change.md`.\n\n================================================================================\n  Next tick: scheduled pipeline tick\n================================================================================\n\r\nadmissions\r\nanalyses\r\nbugfixes\r\ndecisions\r\ndesigns\r\nexperiments\r\nheadless\r\nmonitoring\r\nreports\r\nreviews\r\ncodex_memory.md\r\ndeathwatch.json\r\nexperiments.csv\r\ngoal.json\r\nqueue.json\r\nresearch_work.json\r\nrunning.json\r\n.tick.lockdir\r\n.codex_events_1554.jsonl\r\n.codex_events_387.jsonl\r\n.codex_events_399.jsonl\r\n.codex_events_4552.jsonl\r\n.codex_events_58001.jsonl\r\n.codex_last_model\r\n.codex_prompt_1554.txt\r\n.codex_prompt_387.txt\r\n.codex_prompt_399.txt\r\n.codex_prompt_4552.txt\r\n.codex_prompt_58001.txt\r\n.codex_stderr_1554.txt\r\n.codex_stderr_387.txt\r\n.codex_stderr_399.txt\r\n.codex_stderr_4552.txt\r\n.codex_stderr_58001.txt\r\n.codex_thread_id\r\n.codex_thread_ticks\r\n.goal_preflight_1520.txt\r\n.goal_preflight_357.txt\r\n.goal_preflight_366.txt\r\n.goal_preflight_4422.txt\r\n.goal_preflight_57954.txt\r\n.goal_preflight_7161.txt\r\n.monitor_preflight_1520.txt\r\n.monitor_preflight_1576.txt\r\n.monitor_preflight_357.txt\r\n.monitor_preflight_366.txt\r\n.monitor_preflight_4422.txt\r\n