{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content D:\\\\project\\\\backup\\\\songcl_research_pipeline\\\\log_decision.sh -TotalCount 100; Get-Content AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_o1_language_perturbation.py -TotalCount 135; Get-Content pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-O1-O2_diagnosis_20260926-190200.md -Raw -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\"","aggregated_output":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\r\n# 决策日志 — 记录流水线所有自主决策（自动 + Claude 研究决策）\r\n# 用法: bash log_decision.sh <project> <type> <question> <decision> [rationale] [evidence]\r\n#\r\n# type 取值:\r\n#   early_stop   自动早停 kill\r\n#   queue_push   自动队列推送\r\n#   next_batch   下一批实验选择（Claude 研究决策）\r\n#   route_change 路线扩展/放弃（Claude 研究决策）\r\n#   question     提出但未自行拍板、留给用户确认的问题\r\n#   other        其他\r\n#\r\n# 写入 pipeline/decisions/ 目录（每次决策一个独立 MD + 汇总索引 _index.md）:\r\n#   pipeline/decisions/<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>_<type>.md   单次决策详情\r\n#   pipeline/decisions/_index.md                     决策索引表\r\nset -u\r\n\r\nPROJECT=${1:?Usage: $0 <project> <type> <question> <decision> [rationale] [evidence]}\r\nTYPE=${2:?}\r\nQUESTION=${3:?}\r\nDECISION=${4:?}\r\nRATIONALE=${5:-}\r\nEVIDENCE=${6:-}\r\n\r\nROOT=\"${PROJECT_ROOT:-/home/songcl/3dres/project}\"\r\nPROJECT_DIR=$ROOT/$PROJECT\r\nif [ ! -d \"$PROJECT_DIR\" ]; then\r\n  echo \"错误: 项目目录不存在: $PROJECT_DIR\"\r\n  exit 1\r\nfi\r\n\r\nTSHUMAN=$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')\r\nTSTAG=$(date '+%Y%m%d-%H%M%S')\r\nDEC_DIR=$PROJECT_DIR/pipeline/decisions\r\nmkdir -p \"$DEC_DIR\"\r\n\r\n# 1. 写入独立决策文件\r\nDEC_FILE=$DEC_DIR/${TSTAG}_${TYPE}.md\r\ncat > \"$DEC_FILE\" << EOF\r\n# ${PROJECT} 决策记录\r\n\r\n- **时间**: $TSHUMAN\r\n- **类型**: $TYPE\r\n- **问题**: $QUESTION\r\n- **决策**: $DECISION\r\nEOF\r\n[ -n \"$RATIONALE\" ] && echo \"- **依据**: $RATIONALE\" >> \"$DEC_FILE\"\r\n[ -n \"$EVIDENCE\" ] && echo \"- **证据**: $EVIDENCE\" >> \"$DEC_FILE\"\r\n\r\n# 2. 更新决策索引表 _index.md\r\nINDEX_FILE=$DEC_DIR/_index.md\r\nif [ ! -f \"$INDEX_FILE\" ]; then\r\n  printf '# %s 决策索引\\n\\n| 时间 | 类型 | 问题 | 决策 |\\n|------|------|------|------|\\n' \"$PROJECT\" > \"$INDEX_FILE\"\r\nfi\r\n\r\n# 截断问题/决策到合理长度避免表格炸裂\r\nQ_SHORT=$(echo \"$QUESTION\" | head -c 60 | tr '\\n' ' ')\r\nD_SHORT=$(echo \"$DECISION\" | head -c 60 | tr '\\n' ' ')\r\nprintf '| %s | [%s](%s) | %s | %s |\\n' \\\r\n  \"$TSHUMAN\" \"$TYPE\" \"${TSTAG}_${TYPE}.md\" \"$Q_SHORT\" \"$D_SHORT\" \\\r\n  >> \"$INDEX_FILE\"\r\n\r\necho \"已记录决策 [$TYPE] -> $DEC_FILE\"\r\nimport argparse\r\nimport json\r\nimport statistics\r\nimport sys\r\nimport types\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\nimport gorilla\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\n\r\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\r\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\r\n\r\nfrom ipdn.dataset import build_dataset\r\nfrom ipdn.model_paper5.adares_b4_query_competition import IPDN\r\nfrom ipdn.utils import get_root_logger\r\n\r\n\r\ndef predictor(self, scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints,\r\n              gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp):\r\n    rows = []\r\n    for index, truth in enumerate(gt_pmasks):\r\n        masks = out[\"masks\"][index].sigmoid().gt(0.5)[:, superpoints]\r\n        target = truth.gt(0.5).to(masks.device)\r\n        ious = (masks & target).sum(-1).float() / (\r\n            (masks | target).sum(-1).clamp_min(1).float()\r\n        )\r\n        confidence = F.softmax(out[\"indis\"][index], dim=-1)[:, 1]\r\n        selected = int(confidence.argmax())\r\n        rows.append({\r\n            \"selected\": selected,\r\n            \"iou\": float(ious[selected]),\r\n            \"oracle_iou\": float(ious.max()),\r\n            \"mask\": torch.where(masks[selected])[0].tolist(),\r\n            \"confidence\": float(confidence[selected]),\r\n        })\r\n    return {\"rows\": rows}\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main():\r\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"config\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"checkpoint\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--output\", required=True)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--scenes\", type=int, default=16)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--gpu-id\", type=int, default=0)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--split\", choices=(\"train\", \"val\"), default=\"val\")\r\n    args = parser.parse_args()\r\n    gorilla.set_cuda_visible_devices([args.gpu_id], 1)\r\n    gorilla.set_random_seed(1999)\r\n    cfg = gorilla.Config.fromfile(args.config)\r\n    data_cfg = getattr(cfg.data, args.split).copy()\r\n    data_cfg.training = False\r\n    data_cfg.aug = False\r\n    data_cfg.with_elastic = False\r\n    data_cfg.lang_num_max = 32\r\n    dataset = build_dataset(data_cfg, get_root_logger())\r\n    model = IPDN(**cfg.model).cuda()\r\n    model.eval()\r\n    checkpoint = torch.load(args.checkpoint, map_location=\"cpu\")\r\n    loaded = model.load_state_dict(checkpoint.get(\"model\", checkpoint), strict=False)\r\n    allowed = {\"text_encoder.embeddings.position_ids\",\r\n               \"text_encoder.embeddings.token_type_ids\"}\r\n    if loaded.missing_keys or set(loaded.unexpected_keys) - allowed:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Checkpoint mismatch: {loaded}\")\r\n    model.predict_by_feat = types.MethodType(predictor, model)\r\n    mask_id = 50264  # RoBERTa <mask>\r\n    rows = []\r\n    for scene in range(min(args.scenes, len(dataset))):\r\n        batch = dataset.collate_fn([dataset[scene]])\r\n        tokens = batch[\"lang_tokenss\"]\r\n        valid = batch[\"lang_masks\"].bool()\r\n        first = tokens.clone()\r\n        last = tokens.clone()\r\n        changed = []\r\n        for index in range(tokens.shape[0]):\r\n            positions = torch.where(valid[index] & (tokens[index] > 3))[0]\r\n            if len(positions):\r\n                first[index, positions[0]] = mask_id\r\n                last[index, positions[-1]] = mask_id\r\n                changed.append(True)\r\n            else:\r\n                changed.append(False)\r\n        with torch.no_grad():\r\n            original = model(batch, mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"]\r\n            repeat = model(batch, mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"]\r\n            batch[\"lang_tokenss\"] = first\r\n            first_rows = model(batch, mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"]\r\n            batch[\"lang_tokenss\"] = last\r\n            last_rows = model(batch, mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"]\r\n        for index, (base, control, one, two) in enumerate(\r\n                zip(original, repeat, first_rows, last_rows)):\r\n            def overlap(left, right):\r\n                a, b = set(left[\"mask\"]), set(right[\"mask\"])\r\n                return len(a & b) / max(1, len(a | b))\r\n            rows.append({\r\n                \"scene\": scene,\r\n                \"changed\": changed[index],\r\n                \"base_iou\": base[\"iou\"],\r\n                \"oracle_iou\": base[\"oracle_iou\"],\r\n                \"repeat_iou\": control[\"iou\"],\r\n                \"first_iou\": one[\"iou\"],\r\n                \"last_iou\": two[\"iou\"],\r\n                \"repeat_mask_iou\": overlap(base, control),\r\n                \"first_mask_iou\": overlap(base, one),\r\n                \"last_mask_iou\": overlap(base, two),\r\n                \"first_flip\": one[\"selected\"] != base[\"selected\"],\r\n                \"last_flip\": two[\"selected\"] != base[\"selected\"],\r\n            })\r\n    changed_rows = [r for r in rows if r[\"changed\"]]\r\n    errors = [r for r in changed_rows if r[\"oracle_iou\"] - r[\"base_iou\"] > 0.05]\r\n    correct = [r for r in changed_rows if r[\"oracle_iou\"] - r[\"base_iou\"] <= 0.05]\r\n    result = {\r\n        \"split\": args.split,\r\n        \"scenes\": min(args.scenes, len(dataset)),\r\n        \"expressions\": len(rows),\r\n        \"changed_expressions\": len(changed_rows),\r\n        \"material_errors\": len(errors),\r\n        \"repeat_mismatch\": sum(r[\"repeat_mask_iou\"] < 1 for r in rows),\r\n        \"first_flip_errors\": sum(r[\"first_flip\"] for r in errors),\r\n        \"first_flip_correct\": sum(r[\"first_flip\"] for r in correct),\r\n        \"last_flip_errors\": sum(r[\"last_flip\"] for r in errors),\r\n        \"last_flip_correct\": sum(r[\"last_flip\"] for r in correct),\r\n        \"base_miou\": statistics.fmean(r[\"base_iou\"] for r in rows),\r\n        \"first_miou\": statistics.fmean(r[\"first_iou\"] for r in rows),\r\n        \"last_miou\": statistics.fmean(r[\"last_iou\"] for r in rows),\r\n        \"peak_reserved_gib\": torch.cuda.max_memory_reserved() / 2**30,\r\n        \"rows\": rows,\r\n    }\r\n    Path(args.output).write_text(json.dumps(result, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n    print(json.dumps({k: v for k, v in result.items() if k != \"rows\"}))\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n# Native diagnostic cycle: O1 and O2\n\n2026-09-26 19:02 Asia/Shanghai. Prepared monitor and goal preflight used once; no training or queue mutation. Native B4-E30 best checkpoint, server-2 GPU0. Inference probes only; no loss backward or admission resource profile.\n\n## O1: Language counterfactual selection\nFixed first/last content-token masking, with unchanged-input repeat control. On 16 validation scenes (441 expressions), repeat mismatch 0, 240 material selection errors. First-token selection flipped in 179/240 errors and 105/201 other expressions; last-token in 169/240 and 100/201. Whole-cohort selected mIoU: baseline 0.49186, first 0.48429, last 0.49538. On 16 separate training scenes (455 expressions), repeat mismatch 0, 107 material errors; first flipped 66/107 errors and 218/348 others, last 66/107 and 193/348. Training selected mIoU fell from 0.83083 to 0.80476/0.81930. The apparent error association is confounded: masking a content token can change referent semantics, and both interventions harm overall training quality. This is not a matched semantic-preserving confidence control. Reject O1; no token-position or fusion scan on validation.\n\n## O2: Global 2D appearance removal\nOn the fixed first 16 training scenes, repeat mismatch 0. Zeroing all 2D features flipped 101/107 material errors and 321/348 other expressions; selected-mask overlap was 0.344 versus 0.315, respectively. Selected mIoU fell from 0.83083 to 0.28600. Global feature removal is a broad out-of-distribution perturbation without error-specific direction; it does not isolate confidence in a particular query. Reject O2 without spending validation samples on a feature-removal scan.\n\n## Gates and limitations\nBoth probes were deterministic and ran with peak reserved GPU memory 4.01 GiB (O1 validation), 3.46 GiB (O1 training and O2 training). These are inference-only bounded measurements, not native backward execution, training resources or worst-case memory. Diagnosis and matched-control gates fail; implementation, admission receipt, sync and dispatch are unauthorized. O1 first validation cohort matches the previously fixed 16-scene diagnostic subset, so no numerical intervention may be selected from it. No full literature novelty or theoretical derivation claim. A future independent mechanism needs a frozen paired native control and all six gates before admission.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_n2_same_object.py -TotalCount 100; Get-Content AdaRES/configs_song/model_paper5/adares_b4_query_competition_res.yaml -TotalCount 90; Get-Content D:\\\\project\\\\backup\\\\songcl_research_pipeline\\\\references\\\\formats.md | Select-String -Pattern '\"'^## 3'\"\\\\.|\"'^## 4'\"\\\\.' -Context 0,65\"","aggregated_output":"import argparse\r\nimport json\r\nimport sys\r\nimport types\r\nfrom collections import defaultdict\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\nimport gorilla\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\n\r\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\r\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\r\n\r\nfrom ipdn.dataset import build_dataset\r\nfrom ipdn.model_paper5.adares_b4_query_competition import IPDN\r\nfrom ipdn.utils import get_root_logger\r\n\r\n\r\ndef predictor():\r\n    def predict_by_feat(self, scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints,\r\n                        gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp):\r\n        rows = []\r\n        for index, truth in enumerate(gt_pmasks):\r\n            masks = out[\"masks\"][index].sigmoid().gt(0.5)[:, superpoints]\r\n            target = truth.gt(0.5).to(masks.device)\r\n            ious = (masks & target).sum(-1).float() / (\r\n                (masks | target).sum(-1).clamp_min(1).float()\r\n            )\r\n            scores = F.softmax(out[\"indis\"][index], dim=-1)[:, 1]\r\n            selected = int(scores.argmax())\r\n            oracle = int(ious.argmax())\r\n            rows.append({\r\n                \"scene\": self.probe_scene,\r\n                \"object_ids\": [int(v) for v in object_idss[index]],\r\n                \"language\": self.probe_language[index].tolist(),\r\n                \"selected_iou\": float(ious[selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_iou\": float(ious[oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_mask\": torch.where(masks[selected])[0].tolist(),\r\n                \"oracle_mask\": torch.where(masks[oracle])[0].tolist(),\r\n            })\r\n        return {\"rows\": rows}\r\n    return predict_by_feat\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main():\r\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"config\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"checkpoint\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--scenes\", type=int, default=16)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--gpu-id\", type=int, default=1)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--output\", required=True)\r\n    args = parser.parse_args()\r\n    gorilla.set_cuda_visible_devices([args.gpu_id], 1)\r\n    gorilla.set_random_seed(1999)\r\n    cfg = gorilla.Config.fromfile(args.config)\r\n    data_cfg = cfg.data.val.copy()\r\n    data_cfg.training = False\r\n    data_cfg.aug = False\r\n    data_cfg.with_elastic = False\r\n    data_cfg.lang_num_max = 32\r\n    dataset = build_dataset(data_cfg, get_root_logger())\r\n    model = IPDN(**cfg.model).cuda()\r\n    checkpoint = torch.load(args.checkpoint, map_location=\"cpu\")\r\n    loaded = model.load_state_dict(checkpoint.get(\"model\", checkpoint), strict=False)\r\n    allowed = {\"text_encoder.embeddings.position_ids\", \"text_encoder.embeddings.token_type_ids\"}\r\n    if loaded.missing_keys or set(loaded.unexpected_keys) - allowed:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Checkpoint mismatch: {loaded}\")\r\n    model.eval()\r\n    def capture_language(module, inputs):\r\n        language, mask = inputs[3], inputs[4].bool()\r\n        valid = mask.unsqueeze(-1).to(language.dtype)\r\n        pooled = (language * valid).sum(1) / valid.sum(1).clamp_min(1)\r\n        model.probe_language = F.normalize(pooled, dim=-1)\r\n\r\n    model.dec.register_forward_pre_hook(capture_language)\r\n    model.predict_by_feat = types.MethodType(predictor(), model)\r\n    rows = []\r\n    for scene in range(min(args.scenes, len(dataset))):\r\n        model.probe_scene = scene\r\n        with torch.no_grad():\r\n            rows.extend(model(dataset.collate_fn([dataset[scene]]), mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"])\r\n    groups = defaultdict(list)\r\n    for row in rows:\r\n        if len(row[\"object_ids\"]) == 1:\r\n            groups[(row[\"scene\"], row[\"object_ids\"][0])].append(row)\r\n    pairs = []\r\n    for (scene, object_id), group in groups.items():\r\n        if len(group) < 2:\r\n            continue\r\n        for index, left in enumerate(group):\r\n            for right in group[index + 1:]:\r\n                a, b = set(left[\"selected_mask\"]), set(right[\"selected_mask\"])\r\n                c, d = set(left[\"oracle_mask\"]), set(right[\"oracle_mask\"])\r\n                pairs.append({\r\n                    \"scene\": scene,\r\n                    \"object_id\": object_id,\r\n                    \"selected_overlap\": len(a & b) / max(1, len(a | b)),\r\n                    \"oracle_overlap\": len(c & d) / max(1, len(c | d)),\r\n                    \"left_iou\": left[\"selected_iou\"],\r\nwork_dir: /bak_home/songcl/Project/AdaRES_project/AdaRES_checkpoints\r\ntrain:\r\n  seed: 1999\r\n  epochs: 30\r\n  interval: 1\r\n  pretrain: /bak_home/songcl/3D_visual_grounding/data/ipdn_data/data/sp_unet_backbone.pth\r\n  save_epoch: 100\r\n  grad_clip: 0.1\r\n\r\ntest:\r\n  seed: 1999\r\n  test_topk_per_scene: 100\r\n  test_score_thresh: 0.0\r\n  test_npoint_thresh: 100\r\n\r\ndataloader:\r\n  train:\r\n    batch_size: 2\r\n    num_workers: 4\r\n    persistent_workers: True\r\n  val:\r\n    batch_size: 1\r\n    num_workers: 2\r\n    persistent_workers: True\r\n  test:\r\n    batch_size: 1\r\n    num_workers: 1\r\n    persistent_workers: True\r\n\r\ndata:\r\n  train:\r\n    type: scannetv2_sample_graph_edge\r\n    dataset: scanrefer\r\n    data_root: /bak_home/songcl/3D_visual_grounding/data/ipdn_data/data/\r\n    prefix: train\r\n    suffix: .pth\r\n    training: True\r\n    mode: 4\r\n    aug: True\r\n    with_elastic: True\r\n    use_xyz: True\r\n    voxel_cfg:\r\n      scale: 50\r\n      spatial_shape: [128, 512]\r\n      max_npoint: 2500000\r\n    max_des_len: 78\r\n    lang_num_max: 4\r\n  val:\r\n    type: scannetv2_sample_graph_edge\r\n    dataset: scanrefer\r\n    data_root: /bak_home/songcl/3D_visual_grounding/data/ipdn_data/data/\r\n    prefix: val\r\n    suffix: .pth\r\n    training: False\r\n    aug: False\r\n    with_elastic: False\r\n    use_xyz: True\r\n    voxel_cfg:\r\n      scale: 50\r\n      spatial_shape: [128, 512]\r\n      max_npoint: 2500000\r\n    max_des_len: 78\r\n    lang_num_max: 32\r\n\r\nmodel:\r\n  input_channel: 6\r\n  blocks: 5\r\n  block_reps: 2\r\n  media: 32\r\n  normalize_before: True\r\n  return_blocks: True\r\n  pool: mean\r\n  infer_mode: sem\r\n  fps_num: 256\r\n  task_type: res\r\n  sampling_module:\r\n    num_proposal: 128\r\n    pc_dim: 256\r\n    lang_dim: 256\r\n    d_model: 256\r\n  dec:\r\n    num_layer: 6\r\n    d_model: 256\r\n    nhead: 8\r\n    hidden_dim: 1024\r\n    dropout: 0.0\r\n    activation_fn: gelu\r\n    iter_pred: True\r\n    attn_mask: True\r\n    kernel: top1\r\n\r\n> ## 3. Queue Status\r\n  | Position | ID   | Config                           | Status  | Depends On    | Server     |\r\n  |----------|------|----------------------------------|---------|---------------|------------|\r\n  | 1        | XXX  | ...                              | waiting | —             | server-X   |\r\n  | 2        | YYY  | ...                              | waiting | XXX           | server-X   |\r\n  | ...      |      |                                  |         |               |            |\r\n  Active capacity: A active (R running, C claiming, W waiting) / N target → capacity OK / NEED MORE；candidate budget =\r\n B\r\n  \r\n> ## 4. This Tick's Actions\r\n    - [自主早停] <action> — <result>\r\n    - [队列推送] <action> — <result>\r\n    - [代码同步] <action> — <result>\r\n    - [终态判定] <action> — <result>\r\n    - [实验设计] <action> — <result>\r\n    (无动作时写 \"No actions taken. All stable.\")\r\n  \r\n  ## 5. Decisions Made\r\n    - [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] <type>: <decision> (见 pipeline/decisions/_index.md)\r\n    (无决策时写 \"No decisions this tick.\")\r\n  \r\n  ================================================================================\r\n    Next tick: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n  ```\r\n  \r\n  **格式强制检查**:\r\n  - 第 0 段: Goal Status — 每次必写。无 goal.json 写 \"No goal defined.\"，有则显示 target/champion/gap/phase\r\n  - 第 1 段: GPU Overview — 只列白名单内的服务器和卡\r\n  - 第 2 段: Running Experiments — 必须含 10 列(ID/Config/Server/GPU/Epoch/Best-mIoU/Acc50/spmIOU/No-Impr/Status)\r\n  - 第 3 段: Queue Status — 队列顺序 + 深度判定\r\n  - 第 4 段: This Tick's Actions — 每次必写，无动作也说\"No actions\"\r\n  - 第 5 段: Decisions Made — 每次必写，无决策也说\"No decisions\"\r\n  - **禁止精简格式**：不允许 `## GPU: server-4 GPU0(...), GPU1(...)` 这类单行合并。即使无变化，每个段落标题必须独立出现\r\n，GPU/Running 表格必须完整展开。\r\n  - 结尾: Next tick 时间\r\n  \r\n  **用户前台询问**: 用户说\"查看 pipeline 状态\"/\"实验进度\"/\"pipeline 报告\"等:\r\n  - 按六段固定格式现场输出\r\n  - **必须同步写入** `pipeline/reports/summary_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>_manual.md`。使用 bash `cat > file << 'EOF' ... EOF` 写\r\n入，内容即上述六段格式的完整输出。不要跳过这一步。\r\n  - `_manual` 后缀区分 cron 触发 vs 手动查询，方便事后追溯\r\n  \r\n  ---\r\n  \r\n  ## 2. 终态结果分析\r\n  \r\n  每个实验判定为终态后，**cron tick 必须自动生成该文件**。后续实验设计的 Phase 1 分析主要读取这组文件。\r\n  \r\n  ```\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n    Experiment Result Analysis — <project_name>\r\n    Experiment: <experiment_id> | State: <state>\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n  \r\n  ## 1. Basic Info\r\n    - ID: <id>\r\n    - Config: <config_path>\r\n    - Server: <server> | GPU: <gpu_id>\r\n    - Started: <start_time> | Finished: <end_time> | Duration: <Xs/h>\r\n    - State: done_complete | done_earlystop | crashed\r\n  \r\n  ## 2. Best Metrics\r\n    | Metric   | Value  | @ Epoch |\r\n    |----------|--------|---------|\r\n    | mIoU     | X.XXXX | N       |\r\n    | Acc@50   | X.XXX  | N       |\r\n    | spmIOU   | X.XXXX | N       |\r\n    (if crashed: last saved mIoU before crash)\r\n  \r\n> ## 3. Convergence Summary\r\n    - Best first reached at: epoch <N>\r\n    - Subsequent no_improve epochs: <K> (if early-stopped)\r\n    - Final epoch best: mIoU=X.XXXX vs historical best=X.XXXX\r\n    - (简要描述收敛形态: 快速上升后平台/震荡/一直未收敛)\r\n  \r\n> ## 4. Comparison\r\n    - vs baseline (<baseline_id>): γ = +0.00XX (有效) / -0.00XX (失败) / ≈0 (持平)\r\n    - vs current champion (<champion_id>): γ = ±0.00XX\r\n    - (列出所有可对比的前置实验)\r\n  \r\n  ## 5. Conclusion\r\n    - 结论: [有效] / [失败] / [持平]\r\n    - 解释: <一句话说清这个实验证明了什么>\r\n    - 对后续实验设计的建议: <复现验证? 扩展该方向? 放弃?>\r\n  \r\n  ## 6. Crash Info (if crashed)\r\n    - Error type: <import / CUDA OOM / dimension mismatch / ...>\r\n    - Error message excerpt: <first 5 lines>\r\n    - Auto-fix attempt: <Y/N> — <retries> retries, result: <fixed/abandoned>\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n  ```\r\n  \r\n  ---\r\n  \r\n> ## 3. 实验设计\r\n  \r\n  `pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md`，7 段格式：\r\n  \r\n  ```\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n    Experiment Design — <project_name>\r\n    <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n  \r\n  ## 1. Motivation（为什么设计这批实验）\r\n    - 项目动机（直接引用 goal.json description）: <goal.description>\r\n  | ...           | ...                     | done_complete  | 0.5012    | 0.552  | 0.460  | 50     |\r\n-----|----------|------------|\r\n  | 1 | <id>          | configs/.../xxx.yaml   | <这个实验验证什么假设? 为什么预期> 0.50?       | > baseline 0.4956    \r\n      | P0       | —          |\r\n  | 2 | <id>          | configs/.../yyy.yaml   | <假设>                                         | > current best 0.5012\r\n      | P1       | <id1>      |\r\n  | 3 | <id>          | configs/.../zzz.yaml   | <假设>                                         | complement evidence c\r\nhain  | P2       | —          |\r\n  \r\n  ## 5. GPU Allocation Plan（GPU 分配计划）\r\n  | Server   | GPU | Assignment              | Config                       | Justification            |\r\n  |----------|-----|-------------------------|------------------------------|--------------------------|\r\n  | server-4 | 0   | 当前 running: l1_refine | ...                          | —                        |\r\n  | server-4 | 1   | 当前 running: l1_detail | ...                          | —                        |\r\n  | server-4 | 0   | Next: <id>              | configs/.../xxx.yaml         | first free card gets P0  |\r\n  | server-4 | 1   | Next: <id>              | configs/.../yyy.yaml         | second card gets P1      |\r\n    空闲卡均为 FIFO 队列顺序分配，不绑定卡号(gpu 字段不写或写 None)\r\n  \r\n  ## 6. Implementation Checklist（实施清单）\r\n    - [ ] 检查现有 config 是否可直接复用或仅需 YAML 参数变更\r\n    - [ ] 如需新 model 代码: <描述变更内容, 文件路径, 预计行数>\r\n    - [ ] 创建 config YAML: configs/<path>/<name>.yaml\r\n    - [ ] git add + commit + push\r\n    - [ ] **sync 到所有可用服务器**（见 SKILL.md「代码同步规则」）\r\n    - [ ] 更新 pipeline/queue.json (追加到 gpu_queues.server-X 队尾)\r\n    - [ ] 验证: 下次 cron tick 跑 pipeline_monitor 确认新任务正常启动\r\n  \r\n  ## 7. Risk Assessment（风险评估）\r\n    - 代码风险: （是否涉及新 model 包 / 结构性改动 / CUDA 扩展?）\r\n    - 资源风险: （是否需要更多 GPU 显存? 是否影响其他项目?）\r\n    - 数据风险: （是否需要新数据集? 现有数据够不够?）\r\n    - 失败回退: （如果 crash 3 次，怎么处理? 跳回哪个方向?）\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n    Status: DRAFT | APPROVED | IMPLEMENTED\r\n    Designed by: Research Pipeline (autonomous)\r\n    Created: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n  ```\r\n  \r\n  ---\r\n  \r\n> ## 4. 动机审查\r\n  \r\n  `pipeline/reviews/motivation_review_<ts>.md`，6 段格式。是 exp_design 的**上游分析**，每次自主设计实验前必须生成。\r\n  \r\n  ```\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n    Motivation Review — <project_name>\r\n    <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n  \r\n  ## 1. Goal\r\n    - 引用 pipeline/goal.json 完整内容\r\n    - 当前 target / champion / gap\r\n  \r\n  ## 2. Story Status（故事线状态）\r\n    | 假设 | 状态 | 证据 | 缺口 |\r\n    |------|------|------|------|\r\n    | 聚类路由提升特征表达 | confirmed | posA_l1 0.5012 vs base 0.4894 (γ=+0.0118) | 需要消融哪些设计必要 |\r\n    | ... | partial | ... | ... |\r\n  \r\n> ## 3. Experiment Assessment（已有实验的动机视角评估）\r\n    对每个已完成实验:\r\n    | Experiment | mIoU | 与动机的关系 | 对故事线贡献 |\r\n    |------------|------|-------------|-------------|\r\n    | posA_l1 | 0.5012 | 直接验证 cluster_attn 路由 | 确认核心假设 ✓ |\r\n    | posB | 0.4953 | 消融位置编码类型 | 排除 posB, posA 最优 |\r\n    | ... | ... | ... | ... |\r\n  \r\n> ## 4. Gap Analysis（Q1: 故事缺什么）\r\n    - 已验证: ...\r\n    - 未验证: ...\r\n    - 矛盾/疑问: ...\r\n  \r\n  ## 5. Design Rationale（Q2+Q3: 为什么设计这批变体）\r\n    - 每个变体填补哪个缺口\r\n    - 预期结果对故事线的推进\r\n  \r\n  ## 6. Next Batch\r\n    → 见 pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n  ```\r\n  \r\n  ---\r\n  \r\n  ## 5. 消融方案\r\n  \r\n  `pipeline/designs/ablation_plan_<ts>.md`，PHASE1_REACHED 后生成、与用户讨论用：\r\n  \r\n  ```\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n    Ablation Plan — <project_name>\r\n    Champion: <champion_id> (mIoU=X.XXXX, config=<path>)\r\n    <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n  \r\n  ## 1. Champion Architecture Analysis\r\n    - Config: configs/.../xxx.yaml\r\n    - Model: <model_package>\r\n    - Key design choices:\r\n      1. <设计选择1>: <描述> (config 字段: xxx)\r\n      2. <设计选择2>: <描述> (config 字段: yyy)\r\n      3. ...\r\n  \r\n  ## 2. Proposed Ablations\r\n  | # | ID | 消融什么 | 对照实验 | 假设 | 预计 Δ | Priority |\r\n  |---|----|---------|---------|------|--------|----------|\r\n  | 1 | abl-XX | 去掉 L1 loss | l1_weight=0 | L1 对收敛稳定关键 | -0.005~-0.010 | P0 |\r\n  | 2 | abl-YY | pos encoding A→B | pos_enc=B | posA 优于 B | -0.003~-0.008 | P1 |\r\n  | 3 | abl-ZZ | 关掉 refine | refine=false | refine 收益 0.003 | -0.003 | P1 |\r\n  \r\n> ## 3. Implementation Details\r\n    (每个消融的 config 路径、改动点、是否需要新 model 代码)\r\n  \r\n> ## 4. GPU Allocation\r\n    (消融实验的排队计划，与现有队列的优先级协调)\r\n  \r\n  ================================================================================\r\n    Status: DRAFT → DISCUSSING → APPROVED → IMPLEMENTING → DONE\r\n    Created: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>\r\n    Approved: (用户确认时间)\r\n  ================================================================================\r\n  ```\r\n  \r\n  ---\r\n  \r\n  ## 6. 决策记录与索引\r\n  \r\n  单次决策 `pipeline/decisions/<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>_<type>.md`（由 `log_decision.sh` 写入，无需手写）：\r\n  \r\n  ```\r\n  # <project> 决策记录\r\n  \r\n  - **时间**: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\r\n  - **类型**: early_stop | queue_push | next_batch | route_change | question | manual | manual_batch | other\r\n  - **问题**: <当时面临的选择，含关键数字>\r\n  - **决策**: <具体动作，哪个 config、哪台服务器、哪块 GPU>\r\n  - **依据**: <判断逻辑>\r\n  - **证据**: <数据来源，如 pipeline_monitor 输出、experiments.csv 等>\r\n  ```\r\n  \r\n  索引 `pipeline/decisions/_index.md`：\r\n  \r\n  ```\r\n  # <project> 决策索引\r\n  \r\n  | 时间 | 类型 | 问题 | 决策 |\r\n  |------|------|------|------|\r\n  | 2026-07-17 06:56:46 | route_change | A3 true_route 已 kill... | 推送 B4 refine 变体... |\r\n  ```\r\n  \r\n  ---\r\n  \r\n  ## 7. Crash 修复记录\r\n  \r\n  `pipeline/bugfixes/bugfix_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>.md`：\r\n  \r\n  ````\r\n  # Bugfix: <简短描述>\r\n  \r\n  - **时间**: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\r\n  - **实验**: <experiment_id>\r\n  - **错误类型**: <import / CUDA OOM / dimension mismatch / ...>\r\n  - **错误日志摘要**:\r\n    ```\r\n    <关键错误行>\r\n    ```\r\n  - **根因**: <一句话定位>\r\n  - **修复**:\r\n    ```diff\r\n    <修复的 diff>\r\n    ```\r\n  - **重试**: 第 <N> 次，结果: <fixed / still failing / abandoned>\r\n  ````\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content D:\\\\project\\\\backup\\\\songcl_research_pipeline\\\\references\\\\autonomous_design.md | Select-String -Pattern '## Phase 1.7|## Phase 2:|准入|native|receipt' -Context 2,10 | Select-Object -First 35\"","aggregated_output":"\r\n  未完成候选以稳定 ID 保存到 research_work.json；event 续做具体阶段，\r\n  不要因新增 review/design 就将仍缺原生验证的工作判作闭环。\r\n> 新入队任务必须具有机器可校验的准入 receipt；训练闭环必须观察步数增长。\r\n  \r\n  cron tick 会话的行为准则。触发条件：**running + claiming + waiting < 可用容量槽位数 + design_buffer** 时，Codex 按缺\r\n口自主完成实验设计 → 实现变体 → 补充队列。全部文档格式见 `references/formats.md`。\r\n  \r\n  > **可用卡数定义**（不要搞混）: = 该项目 SERVERS.yaml 各 gpu_server 的**容量槽位总和** = Σ(白名单卡数 × `max_tasks_pe\r\nr_gpu`)（**容量，固定值**），≠ 当前空闲卡。当前 cluster server-4 [0,1]（max=1）→ 2，server-6 [7]（max=2）→ 2，合计=4；m\r\nultiview server-6 [1,2]（max=1）→ 2。不配 `max_tasks_per_gpu` 时每卡按 1 槽位算。\"空闲卡\"(util<10%且显存<1GB；单卡多任\r\n务模式下=槽位未满且显存余量>20GB) 只决定**推送时机**，不进深度公式。所有数值始终以项目 `SERVERS.yaml` 为准。\r\n  \r\n> > **候选预算定义**：`active_count = running + claiming + waiting`；`target_active = capacity + design_buffer`；`candi\r\ndate_budget = min(max_candidates_per_design_tick, max(0, target_active - active_count))`。设计模式以 `candidate_budget`\r\n 为本轮目标数量。只有通过全部科学准入、独立实现和测试的候选才能入队；合格候选少于预算时允许留空，必须记录每个未入队候选\r\n的淘汰原因。\r\n  \r\n  核心原则：\r\n  1. **不等用户** — 不做交互提问，不弹确认，不等待审批。\r\n  2. **直接自主执行** — 基于实验指标、goal.json、已完成分析和决策轨迹做研究决策。\r\n  3. **全量落文档** — 每个动作可追溯，用户事后读文件即可了解发生了什么。\r\n  \r\n  ## Phase 0: 目标检查（进入自主设计前必须执行）\r\n  \r\n  ```\r\n  0. 检查 pipeline/goal.json:\r\n  **Phase 1 产出（硬性）**：分析过程必须存档为 `pipeline/reviews/motivation_review_<ts>.md`（6 段格式见 `formats.md#4-\r\n动机审查`），供后续决策追溯。该文档是 exp_design 的上游分析，每次自主设计实验前必须生成。\r\n  \r\n> ## Phase 2: 设计 → 落文档\r\n  \r\n  - 格式：`pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md`（7 段格式见 `formats.md#3-实验设计`）\r\n  - **容量补齐目标**：`running + claiming + waiting ≥ target_active`。从 `.tick_context.json` 读取 `queue.candidate_bud\r\nget`，不得自行扩大本轮数量。\r\n  - 同批候选必须是结构上和因果假设上可区分的变体，不得通过改名、纯数值变化、seed 重复或 Phase 1 纯消融扩充数量。\r\n  \r\n  ## Phase 3: 实现 → 入队\r\n  \r\n  ```\r\n  1. 检查现有 config 是否可直接复用或仅需 YAML 参数变更\r\n  2. 如需新 model 代码: 写代码\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
