conditioned 3D/2D agreement: oracle higher in 148/388 train64 material errors versus outside-mask control 207/388; standalone mIoU 0.09220 versus B4 0.82256. Reopen only with a distinct inference-valid causal mechanism and prospective controls, not a feature or weight scan.\",\r\n      \"evidence\": [\r\n        {\"path\": \"AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_u1_cross_modal_agreement.py\", \"sha256\": \"09d9771a5224a09a4772dc2aaecc5abd2ea004ea1bb70869296dce7334b14a12\"},\r\n        {\"path\": \"pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-U1_cross_modal_train64_20260927.json\", \"sha256\": \"34593792a610e49728a6295b851cdc1ae8ca7fbaded522ec92e7c3101d378730\"},\r\n        {\"path\": \"pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-U1-U2_diagnosis_20260927-010000.md\", \"sha256\": \"5e9188afbd10e366e39e08e5adddfef398b98bc7949917b1eef849f5a77a1826\"}\r\n      ]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"AdaRES-U2\",\r\n      \"stage\": \"rejected\",\r\n      \"next_action\": \"Do not train or scan max-token mask-language compatibility: oracle higher in 179/388 train64 errors versus shifted-language control 182/388; standalone mIoU 0.00814 versus B4 0.82256. Reopen only with new independent token-specific evidence and a native matched control.\",\r\n      \"evidence\": [\r\n        {\"path\": \"AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_u2_token_mask_agreement.py\", \"sha256\": \"34047e0c9107cd96d8fff8fbd5498c52cba642431b4092694bd93de5c30a2274\"},\r\n        {\"path\": \"pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-U2_token_mask_train64_20260927.json\", \"sha256\": \"93769e807a72fcf80e7f8cdde81f01d9866d545cc4e676d73593bf154b81f0f3\"},\r\n        {\"path\": \"pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-U1-U2_diagnosis_20260927-010000.md\", \"sha256\": \"5e9188afbd10e366e39e08e5adddfef398b98bc7949917b1eef849f5a77a1826\"}\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"design_cycle\": {\r\n    \"at\": \"2026-09-27T01:00:00+08:00\",\r\n    \"candidate_budget\": 2,\r\n    \"admitted\": 0,\r\n    \"attempted_ids\": [\"AdaRES-U1\", \"AdaRES-U2\"],\r\n    \"stop_reason\": \"independent_routes_exhausted\",\r\n    \"stop_detail\": \"U1 cross-modal inside agreement 0.09220 mIoU and U2 token-resolved compatibility 0.00814 versus B4 0.82256 on fixed train64; paired error ordering fails outside-mask and shifted-language controls respectively. Both fail diagnosis/control before backward/resource gates. No further distinct evidence-backed executable route identified in this bounded cycle; no global exhaustion claim.\",\r\n    \"evidence\": [\r\n      {\"path\": \"pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-U1_cross_modal_train64_20260927.json\", \"sha256\": \"34593792a610e49728a6295b851cdc1ae8ca7fbaded522ec92e7c3101d378730\"},\r\n      {\"path\": \"pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-U2_token_mask_train64_20260927.json\", \"sha256\": \"93769e807a72fcf80e7f8cdde81f01d9866d545cc4e676d73593bf154b81f0f3\"},\r\n      {\"path\": \"pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-U1-U2_diagnosis_20260927-010000.md\", \"sha256\": \"5e9188afbd10e366e39e08e5adddfef398b98bc7949917b1eef849f5a77a1826\"},\r\n      {\"path\": \"pipeline/reviews/motivation_review_20260927-010000.md\", \"sha256\": \"e7c251913f862edfad365b0af4a63a7ac426235ffc7d86616445842314902cba\"},\r\n      {\"path\": \"pipeline/designs/exp_design_20260927-010000.md\", \"sha256\": \"070e854efe022bbdca92bdc9208f98ea34d69b16a11e066e15eb5fa4e1eb9c29\"}\r\n    ],\r\n    \"resume_condition\": \"Next capacity-gap tick: seek independently justified inference-available metric-aligned confidence evidence beyond U1/U2 and prior rejected routes; predeclare paired native training controls and pass all six gates before admission. Reconcile any monitor/goal event first.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"migration_notes\": \"AdaRES did not previously have research work tracking; B4 and B5 are the first explicit queued records.\"\r\n}\r\n## Phase 3: 实现 → 入队\r\n\r\n```\r\n1. 检查现有 config 是否可直接复用或仅需 YAML 参数变更\r\n2. 如需新 model 代码: 写代码\r\n3. 创建 config YAML: configs/<path>/<name>.yaml\r\n4. git add + commit + push\r\n5. sync 到所有可用服务器（见 SKILL.md「代码同步规则」）← 必须执行\r\n6. 更新 pipeline/queue.json (追加到 gpu_queues.server-X 队尾)\r\n7. 验证: 下次 cron tick 确认新任务正常启动\r\n```\r\n\r\n变体实现优先级见 SKILL.md「变体配置系统」：YAML 标志 > 新 config 子目录 > 新 model 包。\r\n\r\n### Phase 3a: 变体独立性校验（硬性，入队前必须通过）\r\n\r\n每个变体的 model 包和 config 必须**物理独立**，不依赖其他变体或 baseline 的代码路径。入队前逐条验证：\r\n\r\n| # | 检查项 | 验证方法 | 失败处理 |\r\n|---|--------|---------|---------|\r\n| 1 | **model 包独立** | `ls framework/model/<proj>/<variant_basename>/` 存在且非空 | 不存在 → 从父包 `cp -r` 复制，确保物理独立 |\r\n| 2 | **无跨变体 import** | `grep -r \"from.*Quard_model\\.\\(model_\\|pos\\|base\\)\" framework/model/<proj>/<variant>/` 不应命中别人的包名 | 命中 → 改为 import 自己的包，或复制依赖代码到自己的包 |\r\n| 3 | **config basename 全局唯一** | `find configs/ -name \"*.yaml\" | xargs -I{} basename {} .yaml | sort | uniq -d` 无重复 | 重复 → 重命名 basename + model 目录 |\r\n| 4 | **config 不引用别人的 model 包** | config YAML 中 `model` 字段的值必须等于本变体的 basename | 不匹配 → 修正 config，确保指向自己的 model 包 |\r\n| 5 | **代码不 import baseline 的内部实现** | `grep -r \"from.*model_base1\\b\" framework/model/<proj>/<variant>/` 不应命中 | 命中 → 复制需要的工具函数到自己的 utils 模块，或改为 import 公共库 |\r\n\r\n> **为什么这很重要**：如果变体 B 的 config 指向变体 A 的 model 包，当 A 的代码被修改/删除时，B 静默失效。更糟的是如果 A 正在 running 且你改了 A 的代码，B 的复现性就毁了。**物理复制虽然冗余，但买的是隔离性**。\r\n\r\n此校验结果写入 exp_design §6 Implementation Checklist 末尾：\r\n```\r\n- [ ] Phase 3a 独立性校验通过 (model包独立/无跨变体import/config basename唯一/config指向自己)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Phase 3b: Crash 自修复（闭环内闭环）\r\n\r\n```\r\n当自己引入的代码导致 crash 时，自主执行:\r\n1. 读远程 crash 日志（tools/train 的最后输出 + stderr）\r\n2. 定位根因（import 错误/语法错/config 路径错/维度不匹配/...）\r\n3. 修复代码 → git commit → push → sync 到所有服务器\r\n4. 重入队（reset status 回 waiting）\r\n5. 记录 pipeline/bugfixes/bugfix_<ts>.md（格式见 formats.md#7）\r\n6. 如果修复 3 次仍 crash → 放弃该变体，标记为 question，继续下一项\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Phase 4: 汇报\r\n\r\n```\r\n简短报告（写在 cron 会话的输出里，不阻塞执行）:\r\n  - 分析了 N 个已完成实验，最佳 mIoU=X.XXXX (exp_name)\r\n  - 设计了 M 个新实验，已写入 pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md\r\n  - 已入队并同步代码到 server-X, server-Y: [id1: label1], [id2: ...]\r\n  - pipeline 继续自主运行\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# PHASE1_REACHED 后：Phase 2 消融验证流程\r\n\r\nchampion 达标后，Codex 自主生成消融方案、实现、入队并继续闭环；所有动作必须记录到设计与决策文档。\r\n\r\n## 2.1 消融方案设计（Codex 自主执行）\r\n\r\n```\r\nPHASE1_REACHED:\r\n  ├─ 停止自主实验设计（不再补队列）\r\n  ├─ 读 champion 的 config YAML + model 代码\r\n  ├─ 分析 champion 的架构: 列出所有关键设计选择\r\n  │   (e.g. L1 loss, pos encoding, refine mechanism, gate type, ...)\r\n  ├─ 对每个设计选择设计消融变体:\r\n  │   ├─ \"去掉它\" → 预期掉点\r\n  │   ├─ \"替换为简单版\" → 预期掉点\r\n  │   └─ \"换一种实现\" → 对比\r\n  ├─ 生成 pipeline/designs/ablation_plan_<ts>.md\r\n  │   (格式见 formats.md#5-消融方案)\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
